WEBVTT

00:02.994 --> 00:05.294
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:05.434 --> 00:08.464
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.974 --> 00:11.704
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.704 --> 00:16.334
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.784 --> 00:23.744
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:25.484 --> 00:28.354
Dragon Drive

00:28.354 --> 00:33.854
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.994 --> 00:36.964
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.964 --> 00:40.194
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.704 --> 00:45.074
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:45.074 --> 00:47.044
ima mo
I'd still...

00:47.044 --> 00:53.344
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:55.084 --> 00:57.454
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:57.454 --> 01:00.654
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.994 --> 01:05.994
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.994 --> 01:07.554
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.694 --> 01:10.104
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:10.104 --> 01:13.224
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.634 --> 01:18.704
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.704 --> 01:21.444
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:21.444 --> 01:29.114
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:43.434 --> 01:46.304
I think you'd be far better off
just handing Meguru over to me!

01:46.604 --> 01:48.694
Sorry. I promised her that I'd protect her!

01:50.644 --> 01:51.294
Get lost!

01:51.374 --> 01:53.534
Kouhei!

01:56.144 --> 01:57.544
You hate me, right?!

01:58.044 --> 01:59.674
Then come and get me!

02:04.554 --> 02:06.284
I remember.

02:07.424 --> 02:10.394
I finally remember where the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons is!

02:12.264 --> 02:15.394
The Boy

02:18.034 --> 02:18.894
Meguru.

02:18.964 --> 02:20.904
Where is the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons?

02:21.474 --> 02:22.564
Well...

02:30.844 --> 02:31.904
It's raining.

02:32.244 --> 02:33.214
Oh, no.

02:33.344 --> 02:34.904
It's coming down pretty hard!

02:35.254 --> 02:36.774
Let's head back for now!

02:37.124 --> 02:38.674
Rockaku, can you get up?

02:38.924 --> 02:41.394
Are you kidding me?! Of course I can!

02:42.824 --> 02:44.314
Scratches and bruises like this...

02:44.924 --> 02:47.154
...a- aren't gonna keep me down!

02:54.404 --> 02:55.924
Are you sure it's here?

02:56.134 --> 02:57.104
Yes.

02:57.344 --> 02:58.504
If that's so, then...

02:58.574 --> 03:01.304
That's where we first arrived in Rikyu.

03:01.714 --> 03:03.474
What?

03:03.684 --> 03:06.274
So the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons
is located back there?

03:06.784 --> 03:09.584
Actually it's a little north of there.

03:09.954 --> 03:12.584
Hmm... That's the Dragons' Graveyard.

03:13.324 --> 03:14.624
The Dragons' Graveyard?

03:15.224 --> 03:17.254
It's said to be the place...

03:17.424 --> 03:21.454
...where dragons sensing their own death
instinctively gather to die.

03:22.734 --> 03:23.964
A graveyard.

03:24.504 --> 03:26.694
You'd think there'd be ghosts or something.

03:29.304 --> 03:32.504
Darn. I hate thunder.

03:33.544 --> 03:34.844
Don't worry.

03:34.914 --> 03:37.074
Lightning won't strike you
as long as you don't move around.

03:37.814 --> 03:38.744
What are you doing?

03:38.944 --> 03:39.914
Huh?

03:40.154 --> 03:43.514
Uhh... I was trying to protect you!

03:44.754 --> 03:46.654
I'm here for you, so don't be scared.

03:47.724 --> 03:49.914
I'm not scared of thunder.

03:49.994 --> 03:51.854
Huh? Is that so?

03:54.364 --> 03:57.394
But what we have to do now
is get to the Shrine right away...

03:57.504 --> 03:58.834
...before Kouhei gets there!

03:59.264 --> 04:00.234
I disagree.

04:01.234 --> 04:03.264
You mustn't underestimate the weather.

04:03.844 --> 04:06.774
We should go to the Shrine
after the rain lets up.

04:07.374 --> 04:10.834
It'll also give your injuries a chance to heal.

04:11.484 --> 04:15.444
Perhaps this rain is a gift from heaven
to get you some rest, Rockaku.

04:15.784 --> 04:18.084
Get real! I feel just fine!

04:18.254 --> 04:19.614
I don't need any rest!

04:19.754 --> 04:20.954
Oww...

04:21.594 --> 04:23.024
Don't be foolish.

04:23.564 --> 04:27.184
You'll only be a burden on the others
if you go out right now.

04:30.204 --> 04:31.324
Elder...

04:32.334 --> 04:33.824
The sky is distorted...

04:37.374 --> 04:39.134
Does this mean someone's arriving again?

04:39.544 --> 04:40.664
Someone from RI-ON?

04:47.214 --> 04:48.044
Over there!

04:56.424 --> 04:57.754
Chibi! Let's go!

05:10.704 --> 05:11.574
Chibi!

05:21.384 --> 05:22.684
What is that?

05:23.754 --> 05:26.084
I guess someone's coming
from the other side again.

05:27.694 --> 05:29.554
It could be help from Earth.

05:29.994 --> 05:32.084
Help, you say?

05:32.294 --> 05:35.824
Well... it's anyone's guess who
such reinforcements will side with.

05:37.334 --> 05:39.804
But we could have some fun finding out...

05:48.714 --> 05:50.674
Something's coming. Be ready!

06:02.254 --> 06:03.284
What is it?

06:03.354 --> 06:04.584
Why, that's...

06:06.624 --> 06:08.114
He's only a child!

06:11.664 --> 06:13.104
Oh, is that all.

06:13.164 --> 06:15.364
Nothing to be nervous about.

06:16.234 --> 06:17.204
No.

06:17.344 --> 06:19.364
It's too soon to determine that.

06:19.604 --> 06:20.574
Huh?

06:20.874 --> 06:22.274
He's been sent here by RI-ON.

06:22.774 --> 06:24.474
If we take him lightly
just because he's a child...

06:25.184 --> 06:26.344
...we could get burned.

06:26.784 --> 06:28.344
You're taking that child too seriously.

06:29.254 --> 06:32.274
We can see that he's no older
than an elementary school kid.

06:32.524 --> 06:35.384
I can't imagine that even RI-ON would try
and take advantage of such a child.

06:35.494 --> 06:36.894
They just might.

06:38.324 --> 06:39.654
Stop it, Reiji!

06:40.464 --> 06:41.434
Hi!

06:44.334 --> 06:45.354
Cut it out, Chibi.

06:46.304 --> 06:47.234
Who are you?

06:47.734 --> 06:49.264
I'm Reiji Ohzora.

06:49.534 --> 06:51.304
You arrived from Earth, right?

06:52.244 --> 06:53.204
Mhm.

06:54.414 --> 06:55.344
Where am I?

06:56.344 --> 06:57.814
Is this part of Dragon Drive?

06:58.444 --> 07:00.174
You're in Rikyu.

07:00.484 --> 07:01.454
Rikyu?

07:02.054 --> 07:03.174
What is Rikyu?

07:03.654 --> 07:04.844
What am I doing here?

07:05.454 --> 07:06.714
You have no idea?

07:07.454 --> 07:08.324
Mhm.

07:08.394 --> 07:11.224
The game machine broke down
while I was playing.

07:11.924 --> 07:14.524
So he's come here by mistake.

07:14.864 --> 07:16.384
He's lost?

07:17.564 --> 07:19.624
Looks like you were way off, Ichirou.

07:23.634 --> 07:24.624
What's wrong?

07:25.344 --> 07:26.534
Something's coming.

07:26.974 --> 07:28.234
Something with great hostility.

07:28.944 --> 07:30.204
What?!

07:30.614 --> 07:31.704
From there.

07:31.784 --> 07:32.744
Huh?

07:35.614 --> 07:36.644
Why that's!

07:36.754 --> 07:37.724
Kouhei!

07:38.954 --> 07:39.924
Mahiru!

07:40.824 --> 07:41.814
Rockaku!

07:45.564 --> 07:46.524
That boy...

07:47.694 --> 07:49.064
He's just a child.

07:49.334 --> 07:51.734
You're not saying
that he's our help, are you?

07:52.364 --> 07:54.734
Well, well. I understand now.

07:56.274 --> 07:57.234
Let's go!

08:02.774 --> 08:05.744
Is he planning to fight against that boy, too?

08:07.384 --> 08:08.504
Oh, well.

08:08.884 --> 08:10.444
I'll just defeat that guy!

08:11.124 --> 08:12.084
Rockaku!

08:13.184 --> 08:14.124
Here they come!

08:14.194 --> 08:15.154
Right!

08:18.364 --> 08:21.424
Mahiru's still hanging out with Kouhei.

08:23.034 --> 08:24.694
Chibi! We'll use SinnSaber!

08:34.414 --> 08:36.274
Right now, I can aim at you with ease!

08:36.474 --> 08:38.744
I'm not missing my aim this time, Kouhei!

08:40.614 --> 08:42.604
What? Hey, you're in my way!

08:43.354 --> 08:44.284
Move!

08:45.684 --> 08:46.784
Watch out!

08:52.894 --> 08:53.794
Huh?

08:53.864 --> 08:54.764
What?!

08:54.834 --> 08:56.954
That kid did that?!

09:01.674 --> 09:02.464
Mahiru!

09:02.834 --> 09:05.274
Hey, you're pretty good.

09:18.954 --> 09:20.654
I'm impressed.

09:20.794 --> 09:22.554
I was giving it my best shot.

09:23.254 --> 09:24.744
You're pretty strong!

09:25.264 --> 09:26.194
Awesome.

09:26.324 --> 09:27.994
Who is that child, anyway?

09:28.394 --> 09:30.194
He's fighting at Kouhei's level.

09:30.604 --> 09:31.824
Let's help him!

09:32.004 --> 09:33.934
It's our chance to defeat Kouhei!

09:36.474 --> 09:37.934
This is enough for today.

09:38.574 --> 09:39.734
We're retreating!

09:40.404 --> 09:41.274
But...

09:41.344 --> 09:43.574
You can stay here and fight if you prefer!

09:49.614 --> 09:50.674
Get back here!

09:51.524 --> 09:52.984
Going after him could be dangerous!

09:55.994 --> 09:57.114
You're right.

09:59.424 --> 10:01.254
Boy, you're strong.

10:01.464 --> 10:04.594
Well, I used to be the champion.

10:04.964 --> 10:06.934
Huh? What did you say?

10:07.674 --> 10:09.574
I think he said he was the champion!

10:09.774 --> 10:11.004
The Champion?!

10:11.244 --> 10:12.674
Of Dragon Drive?

10:14.814 --> 10:16.774
It must have been after we left Earth.

10:17.414 --> 10:18.714
I imagine so.

10:18.784 --> 10:20.214
What's your name?

10:21.754 --> 10:22.844
What's wrong?

10:23.084 --> 10:24.554
You don't wanna tell me?

10:24.924 --> 10:27.384
This is hardly the place
for a conversation.

10:27.454 --> 10:29.614
- Let's head back!
- Right.

10:37.804 --> 10:39.234
That child we just saw.

10:39.504 --> 10:42.904
It could be problematic for us
to have him join their team.

10:44.244 --> 10:45.364
Possibly.

10:46.444 --> 10:47.734
Aren't you worried?

10:48.144 --> 10:50.664
Things will turn out as they're meant to.

11:18.174 --> 11:20.934
Here! Have some nice, warm soup.

11:21.774 --> 11:23.834
Th-Thank you.

11:28.414 --> 11:29.384
Here.

11:29.654 --> 11:31.814
Hideaki, was it?

11:32.184 --> 11:33.284
Yeah.

11:33.484 --> 11:35.214
At least that's what he says his name is.

11:35.494 --> 11:37.114
So how did he end up here?

11:37.824 --> 11:40.384
Something about his machine breaking down.

11:41.364 --> 11:42.724
His machine?

11:43.394 --> 11:44.884
Find that odd?

11:44.964 --> 11:46.224
Yeah, a little.

11:47.204 --> 11:49.794
Hideaki. Aren't you cold?

11:54.014 --> 11:55.474
I'm all right.

11:55.544 --> 11:57.804
I'm not cold.

11:58.914 --> 12:00.474
O-Oh.

12:01.754 --> 12:03.304
Hungry?

12:04.484 --> 12:05.354
Oh.

12:05.924 --> 12:07.284
He's very quiet.

12:09.324 --> 12:10.484
He's still a child.

12:10.824 --> 12:13.654
I imagine he's in great shock
after suddenly being thrown into Rikyu.

12:14.194 --> 12:18.594
I see you have an understanding
for that delicate part of the human heart.

12:19.164 --> 12:20.634
Of course I do!

12:20.774 --> 12:23.934
I don't know of any man who has
a more delicate heart than I do!

12:24.204 --> 12:27.904
For someone with a delicate heart,
you drink this hot soup like it's water.

12:27.974 --> 12:29.534
Hot? This?

12:34.114 --> 12:35.744
Hey, you laughed.

12:36.054 --> 12:37.314
You find that funny?

12:37.454 --> 12:38.574
Here!

12:38.654 --> 12:40.344
Would you stop that?

12:40.484 --> 12:42.684
Hideaki isn't a baby!

12:43.054 --> 12:45.024
You were the champion, right?

12:45.324 --> 12:47.694
Mhm. I won't lose to anyone.

12:48.064 --> 12:50.624
I saw you fight. You were really strong.

12:51.564 --> 12:52.594
Do you like strong people?

12:53.134 --> 12:54.564
I sure do.

12:55.404 --> 12:56.994
I like strong people, too.

12:57.574 --> 13:00.564
But I've yet to meet
anyone stronger than me.

13:01.144 --> 13:02.374
Is that so?

13:02.514 --> 13:06.204
I'm sure there are a number of people
here that you'll grow to like.

13:06.484 --> 13:07.444
Really?

13:07.554 --> 13:08.514
Yes.

13:10.514 --> 13:13.544
Well, it looks like
he's opened up to Meguru.

13:13.784 --> 13:14.754
You're right.

13:16.954 --> 13:19.084
I wanna be alone.

13:19.664 --> 13:20.854
Are you tired?

13:21.034 --> 13:21.754
Mhm.

13:21.834 --> 13:23.384
All right, then come with me.

13:23.834 --> 13:26.264
I'll show you to your room.

13:27.434 --> 13:28.194
Come.

13:37.044 --> 13:41.074
Hey, he'd be a tremendous help to our team
if we can get him to join us.

13:41.414 --> 13:42.614
He sure would.

13:42.684 --> 13:46.244
He practically fought alone
to force Kouhei back.

13:46.884 --> 13:50.084
Mhm. He'd be a definite plus
to our battle power.

13:50.454 --> 13:53.584
What a shame to hafta rely on some child.

13:54.364 --> 13:56.664
But, I guess it can't be helped.

13:57.464 --> 13:58.934
I'm against having him join.

13:59.204 --> 14:00.694
I don't trust him.

14:00.934 --> 14:03.534
Hey. He's only an elementary school kid.

14:03.874 --> 14:06.174
I have a bad feeling about this.

14:08.574 --> 14:09.664
What was that all about?

14:10.074 --> 14:12.744
He's just jealous. Green with envy.

14:14.284 --> 14:15.444
Use this room.

14:15.814 --> 14:17.084
This other door leads to the bathroom...

14:17.154 --> 14:19.954
You know, I wanna show you
just how strong I am.

14:20.224 --> 14:23.454
That way, I'm sure you'll like me more.

14:23.824 --> 14:24.794
Huh?

14:25.864 --> 14:28.124
I'm really strong, you know.

14:28.464 --> 14:31.524
And I want you to like me a whole bunch.

14:31.834 --> 14:32.924
S-Sure.

14:33.004 --> 14:35.124
But first, you need to get some rest.

14:35.534 --> 14:36.974
You said that you were tired.

14:37.744 --> 14:38.794
Mhm.

14:39.674 --> 14:41.734
Get well-rested.

14:44.714 --> 14:45.804
What's wrong?

14:46.444 --> 14:47.884
Don't you find it strange?

14:48.284 --> 14:49.254
Strange?

14:49.484 --> 14:50.454
That child.

14:51.184 --> 14:54.384
He said he came to this world
because of problems with his machine...

14:55.124 --> 14:56.814
...but isn't the timing all too convenient?

14:57.324 --> 14:58.814
Well, maybe, but...

14:59.424 --> 15:01.524
Suspicious about the mechanical problems?

15:01.964 --> 15:02.864
Yeah.

15:02.934 --> 15:05.864
At least Ichirou seems to be.

15:06.764 --> 15:08.664
RI-ON sent Hideaki here?

15:08.904 --> 15:10.634
You're not seriously thinking that, are you?

15:11.244 --> 15:12.204
I'm not sure.

15:12.704 --> 15:14.334
There's just something fishy about it all.

15:16.014 --> 15:16.974
Hideaki!

15:17.984 --> 15:20.004
You can't trust me either, Meguru?!

15:20.444 --> 15:22.344
I never said that.

15:22.784 --> 15:23.774
I hate you!

15:24.384 --> 15:25.514
Wait!

15:25.724 --> 15:27.654
Where are you going?! Hideaki!

15:33.594 --> 15:34.684
Hideaki!

15:36.734 --> 15:38.164
Are you all right?!

15:40.204 --> 15:41.164
Huh?

15:44.204 --> 15:45.294
Hideaki!

15:45.674 --> 15:46.934
Where do you think you're going?!

15:47.744 --> 15:48.934
What's the matter?

15:49.014 --> 15:50.174
It's Hideaki!

15:51.014 --> 15:52.704
It's too dangerous in this storm!

15:54.454 --> 15:55.714
We must bring him back!

15:57.284 --> 15:58.444
H-Hey!

15:58.754 --> 16:01.454
I'll bet Ichirou said something
to piss him off!

16:01.854 --> 16:03.224
I'm worried.

16:03.324 --> 16:04.384
We'd better go after him!

16:04.494 --> 16:05.354
Yeah.

16:05.424 --> 16:06.894
We can't leave him out there alone!

16:07.494 --> 16:09.394
I'll just hafta go too.

16:10.264 --> 16:11.234
Let's go!

16:15.734 --> 16:17.724
Sorry, but I'm going too.

16:18.074 --> 16:19.734
There's something I wanna check out.

16:20.974 --> 16:22.564
What curiosity seekers...

16:23.374 --> 16:25.934
Don't come crying to me
if you all catch a cold.

16:36.954 --> 16:38.584
I wonder where he went.

16:38.924 --> 16:41.394
Let's just pray that he didn't go to Kouhei.

16:42.334 --> 16:46.464
I doubt it, judging from
the way he acted earlier.

16:47.064 --> 16:49.164
He's just in need of proper love and care.

16:49.734 --> 16:52.604
How should I put it...
he doesn't know how to love others.

16:53.044 --> 16:54.004
Hey!

16:54.714 --> 16:55.874
Where did he go?

16:56.444 --> 16:57.674
I don't know!

16:57.744 --> 16:58.974
I lost sight of him!

16:59.414 --> 17:01.844
Ichirou! What did you say?

17:02.014 --> 17:03.884
If anything happens to him, you're to blame!

17:04.354 --> 17:05.684
What's that supposed to mean?

17:10.324 --> 17:11.584
What's going on up there?!

17:12.364 --> 17:13.624
It looks like a battle!

17:14.064 --> 17:16.824
Could Hideaki be there?!
Let's go and see!

17:22.004 --> 17:22.974
There he is!

17:25.874 --> 17:26.634
Hideaki!

17:30.844 --> 17:32.404
What is that child doing?!

17:41.394 --> 17:45.084
If that collapses, the town will be
completely washed away!

17:46.964 --> 17:47.954
Hideaki!

17:48.464 --> 17:49.624
Meguru!

17:49.694 --> 17:52.254
Rest assured. We're here to help.

17:53.164 --> 17:55.504
How in the world did this happen?!

17:55.934 --> 17:57.994
An evil dragon came and broke it.

17:58.074 --> 17:59.064
That's why!

17:59.144 --> 18:00.544
An evil dragon?

18:00.944 --> 18:02.034
I'll bet it's Kouhei!

18:02.144 --> 18:03.504
So you came here?!

18:04.014 --> 18:07.544
Mhm. I thought it would be awful
if this got torn down.

18:07.884 --> 18:10.284
I guess there's really nothing about him
to be suspicious about.

18:10.514 --> 18:11.484
You're right.

18:14.654 --> 18:15.954
Rockaku!

18:24.094 --> 18:26.154
Are you all right, Rockaku?!

18:29.774 --> 18:31.534
Oh, no! The town!

18:35.914 --> 18:37.204
The town's gonna be swept away!

18:37.644 --> 18:39.914
I'll give it a try and hope it works...

18:41.554 --> 18:42.514
...using that!

18:43.284 --> 18:44.984
What'll you do with that mountain?!

18:45.354 --> 18:47.914
I'll crush it and the rocks
will stop the water!

18:47.994 --> 18:49.184
Chibi! Let's do it!

18:49.624 --> 18:52.494
SinnSaber!

19:19.924 --> 19:20.914
It worked.

19:25.194 --> 19:27.924
Phew. I was worried for a moment there.

19:29.094 --> 19:31.724
Hey, Ichirou! You owe the boy an apology!

19:32.164 --> 19:33.324
You're right.

19:34.104 --> 19:35.964
It looks like it was all
a misunderstanding on my part.

19:36.034 --> 19:37.734
I'm sorry I doubted you.

19:39.644 --> 19:40.934
Was I strong?

19:41.244 --> 19:43.544
Yes. You were very strong.

19:43.944 --> 19:47.104
This town survived thanks to you, Hideaki.

19:48.014 --> 19:50.384
Hey. You're one of us from now on.

19:50.754 --> 19:52.274
Welcome aboard.

19:54.794 --> 19:56.454
Rockaku. Are you all right?

19:56.924 --> 19:59.454
You'd better return and get some rest.

19:59.724 --> 20:00.694
Yeah.

20:03.794 --> 20:05.634
Hey! A rainbow!

20:11.644 --> 20:12.604
Ichirou.

20:12.774 --> 20:15.144
Looks like you lost Meguru to another man.

20:15.314 --> 20:16.274
Yeah.

20:19.384 --> 20:21.874
Are you all going to the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons?

20:21.954 --> 20:24.214
Yes, as soon as we're ready.

20:24.854 --> 20:26.654
You'll join us, won't you?

20:27.084 --> 20:29.424
Where is the Shrine located?

20:30.224 --> 20:32.124
It's located in the wilderness east of here...

20:32.194 --> 20:34.164
...in a place called the Dragons' Graveyard.

20:34.564 --> 20:35.824
Which way's east?

20:35.994 --> 20:36.934
That way.

20:37.264 --> 20:38.664
On the other side of that rainbow?

20:38.964 --> 20:39.994
You're right.

20:40.064 --> 20:42.554
They say happiness is found on
the other side of the rainbow.

20:43.134 --> 20:44.194
Thank you.

20:48.314 --> 20:49.604
What's with them?

20:49.674 --> 20:50.644
Meguru!

20:50.974 --> 20:51.944
It can't be!

20:52.144 --> 20:53.344
No way!

20:53.984 --> 20:55.504
What's wrong?

21:14.204 --> 21:15.434
He's tricked us!

21:15.974 --> 21:16.694
That boy!

21:32.554 --> 21:33.784
This can't be!

21:33.854 --> 21:35.584
Hideaki, are you?

21:57.674 --> 22:00.344
taikutsu datta
I was bored

22:00.414 --> 22:03.114
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:03.184 --> 22:07.124
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.594 --> 22:11.284
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:11.364 --> 22:13.524
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.994 --> 22:18.094
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:19.534 --> 22:22.124
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:22.204 --> 22:24.864
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.944 --> 22:28.894
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:30.244 --> 22:32.674
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.744 --> 22:35.684
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.754 --> 22:40.624
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:41.294 --> 22:43.954
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:44.024 --> 22:46.724
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.794 --> 22:51.424
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:52.164 --> 22:54.864
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.934 --> 22:57.534
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.604 --> 23:02.234
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.914 --> 23:07.404
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:08.354 --> 23:14.014
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:16.324 --> 23:18.914
Next time

23:19.224 --> 23:20.524
We have a problem!

23:20.594 --> 23:22.394
Meguru has been taken away!

23:23.394 --> 23:28.064
So Hideaki was in fact part
of Kouhei's team, sent here by RI-ON!

23:28.934 --> 23:32.604
How dare you trick an older woman
with those sad looking eyes!

23:32.974 --> 23:35.844
What were you the champion of, anyway?!

23:36.844 --> 23:39.174
Next, on Dragon Drive, "Betrayal".

23:39.344 --> 23:42.284
What the boy needs now
is a good, stern lecture!

23:42.654 --> 23:43.354
Let me tell you about life, young man.

23:43.354 --> 23:44.284
Betrayal
Let me tell you about life, young man.

23:44.284 --> 23:44.314
Betrayal

23:44.314 --> 23:45.914
Betrayal
Nag, nag, nag... Bad boy!
